  - No trim() of the whole URL before parsing ("   http://h:80/x" leaves scheme "   http" invalid yet port 80 valid); no trim of port_str is needed since the conversion itself skips leading whitespace.

Step 2 - convert: exactly std::stoi(port_str) (strtol base 10 + i32 range check) wrapped in try/catch:
